<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:SemanticContract> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:canonicalName> "atlas-capture-observer" <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:title> "Committed read-only Architecture Atlas capture and export" <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Produce a portable provenance-bound projection of explicitly selected committed repository carriers for design review and onboarding without reading live runtime state or becoming semantic authority." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:schemaPath> "schemas/atlas-capture.schema.json" <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requires> <urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-refusal:1> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:requires> <urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-timing:1> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "No live local reader, arbitrary filesystem path, shell command, network request, provider dispatch, credential, runtime observation, supervisor interaction, semantic mutation, candidate integration, publication or deployment is permitted." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:contract:atlas-capture-observer:1> <urn:usf:predicate:nonClaim> "A captured path or extracted relationship does not establish runtime invocation, current availability, implementation completion, evidence, proof, deployment or ownership transfer. UXF and UIF remain logical owners even where their available definitions are hosted by USF." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-refusal:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-refusal:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Malformed schema, missing provenance, conflicting source identity, stale revision, changed-during-read input, unsupported language construct, missing source, unsafe path, secret-marked path or resource limit exceeds must remain visible as unresolved or refused and must not be silently dropped." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-timing:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
<urn:usf:requirement:atlas-capture-timing:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Every capture, extraction, build, test, browser and benchmark job records UTC start/end, monotonic elapsed time, exact action and command, source identity/digest, bounded environment, configured limits and result. Missing timing remains unknown. Each accepted site checkpoint keeps scoped README, operator/onboarding guide and extractor help current with the capture contract." <urn:usf:graph:atlas-capture-observer> .
